+# Password Hashing
+
+This project's current recorded decision is to use Argon2id as the password hashing algorithm, chosen for its memory-hard design and resistance to GPU/ASIC-accelerated brute-force and dictionary attacks, with configurable time and memory cost parameters to tune the security/performance trade-off for the authentication system.
